>Is there a maximum character level for an Archon-less ascension or is
>character level not relevant?

Not really. The trouble is once you have the Amulet the dungeon depth is
always that of the Sanctum, and in the endgame the Sanctum plus half your
XL. The upshot is that even with a shallow Sanctum you would need a very
low XL to eliminate Archons from consideration. Even with a DL 45 Sanctum,
you would need to be XL 6 or below, XL 4 in the endgame. Off-by-one errors
excepted.
